{%- comment -%}
  Figma: Components Molecules / Composition bar (2117:21605)
  Vertical bar: a faded Other segment over an Ink Plant oils segment.
  share    plant oil share in percent, the Ink part (Typical about 7, Manjula about 76)
  type     typical | manjula                    (Figma: Type; typical keeps the fade light until 85%)
  class    placement and size (Figma 40x496 desktop)
  Decorative: the list next to it carries the meaning.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign share = share | default: 10
  if type == 'manjula'
    assign fade = 'from-border/50'
  else
    assign fade = 'from-border/30 from-85%'
  endif
-%}
<span class="composition-bar flex shrink-0 flex-col {{ class }}" aria-hidden="true">
  <span class="min-h-px w-full flex-1 bg-linear-to-b {{ fade }} to-text"></span>
  <span class="w-full shrink-0 bg-text" style="height: {{ share }}%"></span>
</span>
